{"metadata":{"taxon":[{"Plain":"Wiki. "},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"Barratt--Eccles 算畴"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“Barratt–Eccles 算畴”"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Barratt–Eccles 算畴 $\\mathcal E$ 是一种 E∞-算畴.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"E∞-算畴","text":"E∞-算畴"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"置换范畴","text":"置换范畴"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}